{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24803","headline":"月生 · 刘猛","name":"月生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月生十五前，日望光彩圆。\n月满十五後，日畏光彩瘦。\n不见夜花色，一尊成暗酒。\n匣中苔背铜，光短不照空。\n不惜补明月，惭无此良工。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘猛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}